#
#	List of PCI ID's — EXCERPT for the hardware tests.
#
#	The format is pci.ids' own (vendor at column 0, devices after one tab,
#	subsystems after two). Device names are as pci.ids prints them; the
#	subsystem entries are illustrative. The real file is /usr/share/misc/pci.ids.
#

# Syntax:
# vendor  vendor_name
#	device  device_name				<-- single tab
#		subvendor subdevice  subsystem_name	<-- two tabs

